            <note corresp="#d530-f2" n="3" xml:id="d530-f2-content">
                <p>The note of September 23 (not printed) stated that the Minister was communicating
                    a copy of the Norwegian note of September 15 to the Department of State for its
                    information.</p>
            </note>
